# Template. Copy to .env.local and fill in real values.
# .env.local is gitignored; this file is committed.

# Web3Forms access key for the contact form (docs/build-spec.md §10).
# Free key from https://web3forms.com — enter your email, they send it back.
# Public by design: it only permits sending mail to the site owner's address.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-access-key-here
